Third-party components and data (not covered by this licence):
- src/formflow/lift/dstformer.py is a port of the DSTformer from MotionBERT
  (https://github.com/Walter0807/MotionBERT, Apache-2.0, Zhu et al., ICCV 2023). The MotionBERT
  checkpoints downloaded at first run are distributed by their authors under Apache-2.0.
- RTMPose and YOLOX ONNX models (OpenMMLab, Apache-2.0) are downloaded at first run.
- samples/: clips from Wikimedia Commons - US Army videos in the public domain and CC BY 3.0 / CC0
  clips; authors and licences are listed per file in samples/README.md and samples/*.json. The
  annotated copies are adaptations under the same terms.
- Benchmarks only (never redistributed here): Human3.6M (Ionescu et al., TPAMI 2014; research use,
  register at http://vision.imar.ro/human3.6m) and RepCount-A (Hu et al., CVPR 2022).
- PyTorch: BSD-3-Clause. ONNX Runtime: MIT. OpenCV: Apache-2.0. FastAPI: MIT. FFmpeg (via
  imageio-ffmpeg): LGPL/GPL, used as a separate executable.
